      "hizbQuarter": 6,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 108,
      "text": "And when a messenger[44] from Allah came to them – confirming what was with them, a party of the People of the Book cast Allah’s Scripture behind their backs as if they did not know.",
